# Written by Rusty; remove this line to keep your own version.
# Git keeps only the shared parts of this folder; everything else, including anything new,
# stays on this machine. (A repository whose own .gitignore ignores /.rusty keeps none of it.)
/*
# README.md: this guide to the folder
!/README.md
# .gitignore: what Git keeps of this folder: the shared parts only
!/.gitignore
# guidelines/: the project's code guidelines: rules.json (patterns, size and complexity limits, import boundaries; checked on every edit and before a run finishes) and style.md (the prose style guide the agent is shown before it edits a file)
!/guidelines/
# specs/: spec-driven changes: each change's proposal, design and task list, and the capability specs (Specs page)
!/specs/
# specs.json: where the specs live
!/specs.json
# skills/: the project's own skills
!/skills/
# workflows/: saved workflows (Behaviors page)
!/workflows/
# profiles/: behavior profiles, and config.json naming the default one
!/profiles/
# canvas/: canvas pipelines and their layout
!/canvas/

# Stays on this machine:
# chats/: the Agent tab's conversations, one file per chat
# runs/: event logs of agent and workflow runs
# goals/: goal loops (/goal): each goal's targets, plan, measurements and journal; <id>.checkpoint.json names the snapshot the running pass started from
# findings/: long answers the agent saved as documents
# metrics/: usage and code health history
# observability/: traces of model and tool calls
# notepad.txt: the notepad
